{"shortDescription":"Cairn Homes Plc (CRN)Cairn Homes Plc: Transaction in Own Shares09-Sep-2026 / 07:00 GMT/BST 9 September 2026  Cairn Homes plc (the “Company”) Transaction in own shares  The Company announces that on 8 September 2026 it purchased a total of 147,840 of its ordinary shares of EUR 0.001 each (the \"ordin…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Cairn Homes Plc (CRN)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Cairn Homes Plc: Transaction in Own Shares"]},{"type":"p","children":["09-Sep-2026 / 07:00 GMT/BST"]}," ",{"type":"b","children":["9 September 2026"]}," ",{"type":"b","children":[" "]},{"type":"b","children":["Cairn Homes plc (the “Company”) "]},{"type":"b","children":["Transaction in own shares"]},"  The Company announces that on 8 September 2026 it purchased a total of 147,840 of its ordinary shares of EUR 0.001 each (the \"ordinary shares\") on Euronext Dublin and the London Stock Exchange through the Company's broker Goodbody Stockbrokers UC (“Goodbody”), as detailed below. The repurchased shares will be cancelled.",{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Euronext Dublin"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["London Stock Exchange"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Number of ordinary shares purchased"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["98,578"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["49,262"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Highest price paid (per ordinary share)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["€2.8050"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["£2.4100"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Lowest price paid (per